      "text": "After RLAIF-V preference optimization, the authors report a 63% reduction in video hallucination relative to image hallucination frequency in that stage.", "tone": "good",
      "source": {
        "page": "RLAIF",
        "quote": "We also specifically reduce video hallucination, which is more frequently observed compared with image hallucination, by 63% in this stage."
      }
    },
    {
